--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: DOC_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9b5eaff2e83da124da564122270dcaf9, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 17771982356480
    m_Localized: "Voice note \u2014 Emilia"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772024299520
    m_Localized: "<c>Lukas. If you're hearing this, I didn't come back.</c>\\nI've been looking into what happened at Vitalis. The incident. I found something in the sound and I went back for the rest of it.\\nSomething went wrong. I don't remember\u2026 I don't remember what I'm forgetting.\\nDon't come looking for me. <c>Please. Not you. Stay home. Keep the photo.</c>\\n<i>(breathing)</i> \u2026it's in the walls. I can hear it from here.\\n<i>(footsteps, running)</i>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772024299521
    m_Localized: "Notebook \u2014 2080-11-02"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772024299522
    m_Localized: 'Sublevel C, acoustic lab. The pulse under the plant is not a heartbeat. A heartbeat repeats. This develops.\nI am transcribing it as a score: phrases, rests, returns. Tempo is stable at 41 bpm. Every 3 hours the material comes back slightly changed, like a theme after its variation.\nIt has the shape of an opening. Openings are followed by something.\n<c>Lukas asked why I come home smelling of the cold rooms. I said "work". He laughed and made tea anyway.</c>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772024299523
    m_Localized: "Notebook \u2014 2081-03-13"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772024299524
    m_Localized: 'The score is complete up to bar 212. Then a double bar line. The first act ends there.\nThe second act exists. I can hear where it should start: the rests change length, as if something were waiting for a cue.\nRequested access to the PA central to compare the room''s resonance with the transcription. Denied. Kessler posted a guard at the door.\nI left a copy of the score on the mixing desk. I shouldn''t have.\n<c>Tomorrow is our anniversary. I''ll be home early. I promised.</c>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772024299525
    m_Localized: "Notebook \u2014 2081-03-20"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772024299526
    m_Localized: I heard it. Only the first act, through the walls of Sublevel C. Then nothing.\nI woke up in a capsule. My hands were cold for two days. The machine said my preservation was "successful".\nI did not open the channel. I was in the acoustic lab. I am almost sure I was in the acoustic lab.\nVitalis calls me an "unstable survivor". Termination effective 2081-04-02.\n<c>I didn't tell Lukas about the capsule. I told him I was let go. He held me all night and said it was their loss.</c>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772024299527
    m_Localized: "Notebook \u2014 2082-10-19"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772024299528
    m_Localized: Went back. My old badge still opens the maintenance hatch; nobody revoked it. Nobody revokes anything here.\nThe pulse is louder without people. The building rearranges itself between visits; I mark doors with chalk and the marks are in the wrong rooms.\nThe machine greeted me with a number. I will not write it down.\nI died on the stairs of Sublevel C. I woke up in the capsule again. I lost something. I checked the score and it is all there. So it was something else.\nListen to the heartbeat. The second act starts at the core.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772024299529
    m_Localized: "Notebook \u2014 2083-05-09"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772024299530
    m_Localized: Third time this year. Or fourth. The dates are in the margins in my handwriting, so it must be true.\nThere is a photo in my wallet. A man is holding me and I am laughing. <c>His name is Lukas. His name is Lukas. His name is</c>\nI know I love him. I wrote it here so the machine can't take it.\nThe score now has notes I don't remember writing. Bars 213 to 240. I must have heard them. I must have been closer.\nListen to the heartbeat. Listen to the heartbeat. Listen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772024299531
    m_Localized: "Notebook \u2014 2083-11-17"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772024299532
    m_Localized: I opened the channel.\nI did not open the channel.\nBoth sentences are in my handwriting, on the same page, with the same pen.\nTomorrow I go to the core. If the second act plays, I want to be in the room. If I don't come back, the phone will send the recording. <c>He will come anyway. He always comes anyway. Lukas, don't.</c>\nThe score ends at bar 240. The rest is not written. The rest has to be heard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772024299533
    m_Localized: "Vitalis Konzern \u2014 Notice to maintenance staff"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772024299534
    m_Localized: "TO: Maintenance, Sublevels A\u2013C\\nRE: Low-frequency sound\\nThe rhythmic sound reported in the boiler rooms is plant resonance and poses no risk. Staff experiencing anxiety are reminded that listening to the heartbeat has a documented calming effect.\\nDo not record the sound. Do not hum along. Overtime will not be paid for \"listening breaks\".\\n<i>Ordnung ist das halbe Leben.</i>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772024299535
    m_Localized: "Kessler Sicherheit AG \u2014 Werkschutz patrol log, post 3"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772024299536
    m_Localized: 02:00 Round complete. Nothing to report.\n02:40 Technician asks what is behind Door C-11. Told him it is not his concern. It is not ours either.\n03:00 Round complete. Nothing to report. Floor feels warm.\n03:12 Music on the PA. Nothing to report.\n03:13
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772024299537
    m_Localized: "Vitalis Konzern \u2014 Advertising poster"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772024299538
    m_Localized: "VITALIS REGEN\u2122\\nYour body. Renewed. Again.\\nClinically proven regeneration for the modern workforce. Ask your supervisor about early enrollment.\\n<i>Gesundheit ist Pflicht.</i>\\nSide effects may include fatigue, tinnitus and mild loss of personal history."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772024299539
    m_Localized: "The Mother \u2014 Automatic status report"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772024299540
    m_Localized: 'FACILITY STATUS: DECOMMISSIONED\nPersonnel on site: 0\nPersonnel preserved: {0}\nReports sent to Vitalis servers: 4,112\nReports read: 0\nRecommendation: continue reporting.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772024299541
    m_Localized: "The Mother \u2014 Preservation log, series R-H"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772024299542
    m_Localized: "SERIES R-H \u2014 PRESERVATION LOG\\nR-H-01 \xB7 2081-03-14 \xB7 Cardiac arrest. Acoustic exposure.\\nR-H-02 \xB7 2082-10-19 \xB7 Fall. Sublevel C stairwell.\\nR-H-03 \xB7 2083-01-27 \xB7 Hypothermia.\\nR-H-04 \xB7 2083-05-09 \xB7 Blunt trauma.\\nR-H-05 \xB7 2083-08-30 \xB7 Asphyxia.\\nR-H-06 \xB7 2083-11-18 \xB7 Acoustic exposure.\\nPreservation: successful. Subject retains identity."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772024299543
    m_Localized: "Vitalis Konzern \u2014 Human Resources, termination notice"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772024299544
    m_Localized: Dr. E. Reiner-Hellen, Acoustic Research\nFollowing the event of 2081-03-14, you have been classified as an unstable survivor. Your employment ends on 2081-04-02.\nVitalis Konzern thanks you for your contribution and reminds you that all research, notes and recollections remain company property.\nPlease return your badge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772024299545
    m_Localized: "Vitalis Konzern \u2014 Board, internal memo"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772024299546
    m_Localized: CONFIDENTIAL\nThe event of 2081-03-14 was caused by an unauthorized researcher who accessed the PA central and broadcast unapproved material.\nThe facility will be sealed and decommissioned. No retrieval of personnel is planned; retrieval is not cost-effective.\nRegen production continues from existing stock.\n<i>Vertraulich. Nicht kopieren.</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772024299547
    m_Localized: "Kessler Sicherheit AG \u2014 Incident report, post 7"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772024299548
    m_Localized: 'Broadcast initiated 03:12 from the PA central console.\nConsole log: authenticated by facility system. No badge used.\nGuard on Post 7 (PA central door) reports no one entered or left.\nGuard on Post 7 stopped reporting at 03:14.\nContract status: active. Invoice attached.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772024299549
    m_Localized: "The Mother \u2014 Staff preservation protocol (revision 9)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772024299550
    m_Localized: '1. Personnel who cease to function are preserved.\n2. Preservation requires identity. Identity is confirmed by response to the subject code.\n3. Personnel without identity cannot be preserved. They remain on site. They are not my responsibility.\n4. Each preservation is successful.\n5. The number of personnel without identity is increasing. Cause: outside the scope of this protocol.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772024299551
    m_Localized: "The Mother \u2014 Cryogenic archive index"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772024299552
    m_Localized: "CRYOGENIC ARCHIVE \u2014 INDEX\\nSamples stored: 1,204\\nOrigin: personnel (all)\\nPurpose: Vitalis Regen\u2122 reference material\\nNon-conforming specimens pending collection: 1\\nNote: the archive sings at night. Logged as compressor noise."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772024299553
    m_Localized: "Vitalis Konzern \u2014 R&D minutes"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772024299554
    m_Localized: 'Attendees: R&D Board.\nItem 1: Source of the regenerative compound. Discussion postponed indefinitely.\nItem 2: Yield is up 14% since the night shift was moved closer to the core.\nItem 3: A board member asked what the compound is. The question was struck from the minutes.\nItem 4: Coffee machine on Sublevel B replaced.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772024299555
    m_Localized: "The Mother \u2014 Clinical note: acoustic exposure"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772024299556
    m_Localized: 'Subjects exposed to the first act: preservable.\nSubjects exposed to the complete heartbeat: no longer subjects.\nRecommendation to personnel: listen to the heartbeat. Do not listen to all of it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
